  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The Drake Law Firm is proud to announce that Marie Drake has been recognized as a 2026 Colorado Titan 100 Honoree for the second consecutive year.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The Titan 100 program recognizes Colorado’s top CEOs, executives, and business leaders for their vision, leadership, and industry impact. This recognition reflects Marie Drake’s continued commitment to serving Colorado families with compassion, professionalism, and strategic legal guidance.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Under Marie’s leadership, The Drake Law Firm has continued to grow its reputation in complex family law matters, including high-asset divorce, child custody, parenting plans, and business-related domestic cases.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">“We’ve been intentional about building a firm that delivers both strong legal results and a clear path forward for clients navigating major life transitions,” said Marie Drake.</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">We are honored to celebrate this achievement and grateful to our clients, team, and community for their continued trust and support.</p>\n<p>Read the full press release here:<br />\n<a href=\"https://natlawreview.com/press-releases/marie-drake-named-two-time-colorado-titan-100-honoree\">https://natlawreview.com/press-releases/marie-drake-named-two-time-colorado-titan-100-honoree</a></p>\n"
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>The Drake Law Firm is proud to announce that Marie Drake has been recognized as a 2026 Colorado Titan 100 Honoree for the second consecutive year. The Titan 100 program recognizes Colorado’s top CEOs, executives, and business leaders for their vision, leadership, and industry impact. This recognition reflects Marie Drake’s continued commitment to serving Colorado [&hellip;]</p>\n"
  },
